@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046

### Account Table

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Transactions Table

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions
Accept: application/json

### Credit Transaction

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "accountId": 1,
    "merchantId": 1,
    "categoryId": 1,
    "amount": 123.45,
    "cashBack": 0.12,
    "userDate": "2026-08-03T11:56:00-05:00",
    "notes": "Test Transaction"
}

### Bad Account Id

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "accountId": 999,
    "merchantId": 1,
    "categoryId": 2,
    "amount": -45.67,
    "userDate": "2026-08-03T11:56:00-05:00"
}

### Debit Transaction

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "accountId": 1,
    "merchantId": 1,
    "categoryId": 3,
    "amount": -89.10,
    "userDate": "2026-08-03T11:56:00-05:00"
}

